WEBVTT

00:21:26.329 --> 00:21:30.496
and often not at work. I've felt
like that cartoon character,

00:21:30.829 --> 00:21:34.454
the one with the steam coming out of their
ears because they're so frustrated.

00:21:35.038 --> 00:21:40.038
Now, imagine that steam just building
up inside of you. Why?

00:21:40.204 --> 00:21:43.788
Because I'm often the only woman
in mostly male environments,

00:21:44.246 --> 00:21:46.996
the only black person in
all white environments.

00:21:47.288 --> 00:21:48.913
And when you're in these situations,

00:21:48.913 --> 00:21:50.538
it's so easy to stay quiet

00:21:50.704 --> 00:21:54.288
because you don't want to say something
that makes you even more of an outlier.

00:21:54.996 --> 00:21:56.413
Should I say this? Will they get it?

00:21:56.413 --> 00:21:59.246
Is this perspective unique to my gender,
race or something else?

00:21:59.663 --> 00:22:04.246
You're so focused on making sure you fit
in that everyone around you is OK